 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Columns are any integer; height 0 is the bottom. placePiece inserts the piece at the bottom of the column and pushes that column's pieces up one height. Return true iff afterwards some horizontal, vertical or diagonal line of k consecutive cells, all owned by the moving player, passes through that column. Play continues after a win.",
